ItemDisplay[NMAG !INF !RW NORM CHEST !GEMMED (gth OR ful) ED<19 SOCK=0 CLVL>49 FILTLVL>0 !TOWN]:// Hide 0 socket Gothic Plate and Full Plate Mail with less than 19% ED at character levels 50+
ItemDisplay[NMAG !INF !RW NORM CHEST !GEMMED (rng OR brs OR aar OR ltp) ED<19 SOCK=0 CLVL>19 FILTLVL>0 !TOWN]:// Hide 0 socket Ring Mail, Breast Plate, Ancient Armor and Light Plate with less than 19% ED at character levels 20+
