ItemDisplay[NMAG !INF !RW NORM CHEST !GEMMED (rng OR brs OR gth OR ful OR aar OR ltp) (ED<20 OR SOCK=2) CLVL>29 FILTLVL>2 !TOWN]:// Hide higher-value Normal tier Armors with less than 20% ED or 2 sockets after level 29 on filter levels 3+
