ItemDisplay[NMAG !INF !RW SUP !ETH (SOCK=0 OR SOCK=3) ((xng OR xcl OR xhn OR xrs OR xpl OR xld OR xtp) OR ((xui OR xea OR xla OR xtu) SOCK=3)) ED>18 FILTLVL>4]:%GRAY%%NAME%{%NAME%}%DOT-20%%PX-00%%CONTINUE%// Superior, 3os

