ItemDisplay[(rin OR amu OR CIRC OR HELM OR BELT OR BOOTS OR GLOVES OR CHEST OR SHIELD) (RARE OR CRAFT) LIFE>0 !STAT216>0]:%WHITE%%LIFE%%RED%l%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%
