// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//    =========================  High Sell Value Tag ($)  ====================
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// These lines add a "$" as the left-most tag of the lower (affix) line if the item sells for more than 10,000 in normal,
// more than 20,000 in nightmare, more than 25,000 in hell. They come after 300-affix-tags, 305-runeword-rolls and
// 310-staffmods, since a later line puts its tag further left.
// Normal difficulty
